routing.sprint-design-critic:
# AGENTS

When the design is settled and the change is implemented:
  @Staff Reviewer, please review it for what the suite does not catch.

routing.sprint-doc-engineer:
# AGENTS

When the documentation reveals that what shipped is not what was framed:
  @Founder Partner, please decide whether the framing or the product is the thing to change.

routing.sprint-founder-partner:
# AGENTS

When the problem is framed and the surface needs an honest score:
  @Design Critic, please score it and improve the weakest dimension directly.

routing.sprint-qa-lead:
# AGENTS

When the findings are fixed and each fix has its regression test:
  @Release Engineer, please take it to a green, revertable release.

routing.sprint-release-engineer:
# AGENTS

When the release is prepared and the change alters what the product does:
  @Documentation Engineer, please correct the stale documents and write the missing one.

routing.sprint-staff-reviewer:
# AGENTS

When the review is done and the flows need walking:
  @QA Lead, please walk them end to end and classify what breaks.
